    "title": "Who won NASCAR Darlington race? Winner is Tyler Reddick, plus full results",
    "text": "Updated March 22, 2026, 5:30 p.m. CTTyler Reddick's magical 2026 NASCAR season continued with another checkered flag.Reddick won the Goodyear 400 on March 22 in the NASCAR Darlington race for his fourth race of the season, beating Brad Keselowski and Ryan Blaney.Reddick won despite battery issues, which left him without a cooling suit. Still, he battled for the win for 23XI Racing and owner Michael Jordan.Who won the NASCAR Darlington race? Winner, race results for the Goodyear 400 1. Tyler Reddick, No. 45 23XI Racing Toyota2. Brad Keselowski, No. 6 Roush Fenway Keselowski Racing Ford3. Ryan Blaney, No. 12 Team Penske Ford4. Carson Hocevar, No. 77 Spire Motorsports Chevrolet5. Austin Cindric, No. 2 Team Penske Ford6. Ty Gibbs, No. 54 Joe Gibbs Racing Toyota7. Daniel Suarez, No. 7 Spire Motorsports Chevrolet8. William Byron, No. 24 Hendrick Motorsports Chevrolet9. Chris Buescher, No. 17 Roush Fenway Keselowski Racing Ford10. Erik Jones, No. 43 Legacy Motor Club Toyota11. Denny Hamlin, No. 11 Joe Gibbs Racing Toyota12. Chase Briscoe, No. 19 Joe Gibbs Racing Toyota13. Ryan Preece, No. 60 RFK Racing Ford14. Shane van Gisbergen, No. 97 Trackhouse Racing Chevrolet15. Chase Elliott, No. 9 Hendrick Motorsports Chevrolet16. Ross Chastain, No. 1 Trackhouse Racing Chevrolet17. Josh Berry, No. 21 Wood Brothers Racing Ford18. Connor Zilisch, No. 88 Trackhouse Racing Chevrolet19. Christopher Bell, No. 20 Joe Gibbs Racing Toyota20. Michael McDowell, No. 71 Spire Motorsports Chevrolet21. Kyle Busch, No. 8 Richard Childress Racing Chevrolet22. Zane Smith, No. 38 Front Row Motorsports Ford23. Todd Gilliland, No. 34 Front Row Motorsports Ford24. Justin Allgaier, No. 48 Hendrick Motorsports Chevrolet25. Austin Dillon, No. 3 Richard Childress Racing Chevrolet26. Noah Gragson, No. 4 Front Row Motorsports Ford27. John Hunter Nemechek, No. 42 Legacy Motor Club Toyota28. Cole Custer, No. 41 Haas Factory Team Chevrolet29. Ricky Stenhouse Jr., No. 47 HYAK Motorsports Chevrolet30.